{
  "name": "Faceless Content System — Sheets → VEO3 → TikTok/Reels/Shorts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 1 — Trigger & Prompt Generation\nNew row in Google Sheets → Claude writes a VEO3-compatible video prompt (scene + camera + audio cues) from the row's idea.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-stage1",
      "name": "Stage 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 2 — Prepare & Submit Video Request\nSet the generation variables (aspect, duration, audio) and submit the prompt to VEO3 on fal.ai's queue.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note-stage2",
      "name": "Stage 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [520, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 3 — Monitor Video Status\nWait 10s, poll the fal.ai request, loop until status = COMPLETED.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "note-stage3",
      "name": "Stage 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [920, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 4 — Retrieve & Update Results\nFetch the final video URL, download the MP4, log it back to the sheet, then fan out to TikTok + Instagram Reels + YouTube Shorts.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "note-stage4",
      "name": "Stage 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1420, -60]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": { "item": [ { "mode": "everyMinute" } ] },
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "value": "Sheet1", "mode": "list", "cachedResultName": "Sheet1" },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger-sheets",
      "name": "New Row (Google Sheets)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsTriggerOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Sheets account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" },
            { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-6\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 500,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a prompt engineer for Google's VEO3 text-to-video model, which generates 8-second clips WITH native audio (dialogue, sound effects, ambience). Write ONE vivid, self-contained prompt for a vertical 9:16 faceless short. Describe: the scene, the main subject and its action, camera movement, lighting/mood, and explicit audio cues (ambient sound + any voiceover line in quotes). No on-screen text. Return ONLY the prompt as a single paragraph, no preamble, no markdown. Video idea: {{ $json['Idea'] || $json['Topic'] || $json['Prompt'] || $json['idea'] }}. Style/tone (optional): {{ $json['Style'] || $json['style'] || 'cinematic, high-contrast, scroll-stopping' }}.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gen-prompt",
      "name": "Generate VEO3 Prompt (Claude)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [220, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Anthropic x-api-key" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "prompt", "value": "={{ $json.content[0].text }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "a2", "name": "rowNumber", "value": "={{ $('New Row (Google Sheets)').item.json.row_number }}", "type": "number" },
            { "id": "a3", "name": "aspectRatio", "value": "9:16", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "a4", "name": "duration", "value": "8s", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-vars",
      "name": "Set Variables for Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [400, 180]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://queue.fal.run/fal-ai/veo3/fast",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [ { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" } ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"prompt\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.prompt) }},\n  \"aspect_ratio\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.aspectRatio) }},\n  \"duration\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.duration) }},\n  \"generate_audio\": true\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "submit-veo3",
      "name": "Submit to VEO3 (fal.ai)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [640, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "fal.ai Key auth" }
      }
    },

    {
      "parameters": { "amount": 10, "unit": "seconds" },
      "id": "wait-10s",
      "name": "Wait 10s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [980, 180],
      "webhookId": "veo3-poll-wait"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Submit to VEO3 (fal.ai)').item.json.status_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "check-status",
      "name": "Check Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1160, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "fal.ai Key auth" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "version": 2 },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "COMPLETED",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-ready",
      "name": "Ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1340, 180]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Submit to VEO3 (fal.ai)').item.json.response_url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "get-result",
      "name": "Get Video URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1560, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "fal.ai Key auth" }
      }
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.video.url }}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file", "outputPropertyName": "video" } } }
      },
      "id": "download-video",
      "name": "Download MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1780, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": { "__rl": true, "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id" },
        "sheetName": { "__rl": true, "value": "Sheet1", "mode": "list", "cachedResultName": "Sheet1" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Set Variables for Video').item.json.rowNumber }}",
            "status": "done",
            "video_url": "={{ $('Get Video URL').item.json.video.url }}",
            "prompt_used": "={{ $('Set Variables for Video').item.json.prompt }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [ "row_number" ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "update-sheet",
      "name": "Update Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1780, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "Google Sheets account" }
      }
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.upload-post.com/api/upload",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [ { "name": "content-type", "value": "application/json" } ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"user\": \"REPLACE_UPLOADPOST_USER\",\n  \"platform\": [\"tiktok\", \"instagram\"],\n  \"title\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Set Variables for Video').item.json.prompt.slice(0, 120)) }},\n  \"video\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Get Video URL').item.json.video.url) }}\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "post-tiktok-ig",
      "name": "Post to TikTok + Instagram (upload-post.com)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1780, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "upload-post.com Apikey" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "upload",
        "title": "={{ $('Set Variables for Video').item.json.prompt.slice(0, 90) }} #Shorts",
        "regionCode": "US",
        "categoryId": "22",
        "options": { "description": "={{ $('Set Variables for Video').item.json.prompt }}\n\n#Shorts", "privacyStatus": "private" }
      },
      "id": "upload-youtube",
      "name": "Upload to YouTube Shorts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youTube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2020, 60],
      "credentials": {
        "youTubeOAuth2Api": { "id": "REPLACE_ME", "name": "YouTube account" }
      }
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Posting options\n**Primary path (this node):** [upload-post.com](https://upload-post.com) posts to **TikTok + Instagram Reels** in one call using the public fal.ai `video.url`. Set the `user` field + `Apikey` credential.\n\n**Direct-API alternative (no third party):**\n- **TikTok** — [Content Posting API](https://developers.tiktok.com/doc/content-posting-api-get-started): `POST /v2/post/publish/video/init/` (PULL_FROM_URL with the fal URL) → poll `/v2/post/publish/status/fetch/`.\n- **Instagram Reels** — [Graph API](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram-api/guides/content-publishing): `POST /{ig-user-id}/media` (media_type=REELS, `video_url`) → poll container → `POST /{ig-user-id}/media_publish`.\n\nEach direct path needs an approved app + OAuth that only you can set up.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "note-posting",
      "name": "Posting notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2020, 240]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New Row (Google Sheets)": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Generate VEO3 Prompt (Claude)", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Generate VEO3 Prompt (Claude)": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Set Variables for Video", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Set Variables for Video": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Submit to VEO3 (fal.ai)", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Submit to VEO3 (fal.ai)": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Wait 10s", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Wait 10s": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Check Status", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Check Status": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Ready?", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Ready?": {
      "main": [
        [ { "node": "Get Video URL", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ],
        [ { "node": "Wait 10s", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Video URL": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Download MP4", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
          { "node": "Update Sheet", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
          { "node": "Post to TikTok + Instagram (upload-post.com)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download MP4": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Upload to YouTube Shorts", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": { "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false }
}
